WEBVTT

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:20.320
Cuticle Detective Inaba

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:34.060
Are you sure you're okay with this?

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:37.220
You're so nice, it's tiring.

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:40.340
I'd even kill Joji at this
point if he got in the way.

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:41.790
I have no hesitations.

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:43.770
I will kill Ogino here.

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:54.030
So, you followed the scent here.

00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:56.250
You may be rotten,
but you're definitely my kid.

00:01:56.810 --> 00:01:58.720
I'm not going to forgive you for this,

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:00.640
Soumei!

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:17.960
Oh, no worries. Help him get dressed.

00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:19.030
Sorry about this...

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:20.690
I'm seriously pissed off about this!

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:21.950
Just you wait!

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:25.410
How about you explain
some things, Soumei?

00:02:26.070 --> 00:02:28.620
What did you do with Ogi's body?!

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:33.080
Cop shoots fellow police officer.
It'll make a great headline.

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:34.250
I don't care about that!

00:02:35.140 --> 00:02:37.460
What the hell did you do to Ogi's bangs?!

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:42.180
No one cares about <i>that</i>!

00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:45.180
They were a little long,
so Yataro cut them.

00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:50.350
What did you cut them with?

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:52.860
Sulk

00:02:53.470 --> 00:02:54.660
No...

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:56.020
With those...

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:58.310
With those cheap scissors they
sell at hundred yen shops?!

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:00.750
Inaba-san is in so much shock
that he forgot about gravity!

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:04.100
I'm not going to forgive
you two for this.

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:05.830
I'm going to beat you both to a pulp!

00:03:06.390 --> 00:03:08.700
Oh, please do.

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:11.330
I highly doubt that you'd
be able to attack thi—

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:14.030
Cuticle Bolt...

00:03:14.030 --> 00:03:16.550
...Max!

00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:18.900
Burnt To a Crisp

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:19.880
Hold on a sec!

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:20.750
No hesitation whatsoever?!

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:22.550
There's no need for me to
hold back on Ogi's body.

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:24.680
Well, I know I'm okay and all, but...

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:27.000
Curse you, Ogi, for being so tough.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:29.220
You're sounding like the villain
right now, Inaba-san!

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:32.150
Hey, Soumei, how does it
feel to be in Ogi's body?

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:35.100
Probably used up quite
a bit of energy.

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:38.850
I can go all out, and Ogi still won't die.

00:03:39.470 --> 00:03:41.320
I won't let anyone kill Ogi.

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:45.510
And if I get rid of Yataro,
you won't be able to recover.

00:03:45.510 --> 00:03:47.490
You're just gonna run out of energy!

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:50.870
It would be a bit rough
to lose my vessel right now.

00:03:51.070 --> 00:03:52.670
I'm throwing in some
extra service here.

00:03:55.830 --> 00:03:57.790
Daddy will protect you.

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:01.470
Bring it on, my idiot son.

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:03.620
If you're planning to lay
a finger on my vessel,

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:05.090
I'll kill you right here and now.

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:07.410
Intent to kill!

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:08.630
Inaba-san, did you not notice?!

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:10.250
We're at a serious disadvantage!

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:12.310
The ogre's got two clubs
instead of one!

00:04:12.630 --> 00:04:14.270
Say your prayers, Soumei!

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:17.000
That's my line, my idiot son!

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:21.860
What's going on?
I burned out all at once.

00:04:22.510 --> 00:04:24.110
Since you're more psychological
than physical,

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:26.280
psychological attacks will
probably work better on you.

00:04:27.210 --> 00:04:29.740
Black hair means black aura.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:32.810
The miasma that brings
utter despair to all.

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:35.210
Haven't seen it since
episode one, huh?

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:38.290
Damn, you're so nonsensical.

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:39.690
Ow!

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:41.500
Inaba-san!

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:42.880
Oh. Inaba-san.
Inaba-san!

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:45.800
You've got to be pretty
strong psychologically

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:48.080
to live in a spirit form for so long.

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:52.930
I can heal with white hair.

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:55.840
Though I get super hairy
on the spot I healed.

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:56.700
An afro?!

00:04:57.500 --> 00:05:00.270
The subordinate of Ogi's that you shot
has been healed by now, too.

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:03.390
Your attempt to frame Ogi failed.

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:05.860
His subordinate doesn't blame him at all.

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:08.220
And the bullet was
identified as Yataro's.

00:05:13.010 --> 00:05:16.250
Hiroshi, is your ability infinite?

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:20.460
Red, blond, black, white and brown.

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:23.770
Those are the five colors
that give me powers.

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:26.700
Just the five natural hair colors.

00:05:28.610 --> 00:05:29.480
He flew?!

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:31.180
The special power from brown hair?

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:34.170
Buzz...

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:37.930
So mean...

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:40.070
All of you spraying
me with bug spray...

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:43.650
Sorry! It was sort of an instinct...

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:46.080
I can fly because I get brown
wings from brown hair.

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:47.130
Isn't that amazing?

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:48.320
I'd rather see feathery wings!

00:05:48.770 --> 00:05:50.830
What were you planning
to do by flying, anyway?

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:53.550
Huh? Well, I was aiming for Yataro...

00:06:00.950 --> 00:06:05.610
Oh, yeah... Nacchan was always the
one exterminating roaches...

00:06:05.870 --> 00:06:07.390
How disgusting...

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:10.360
You should be more careful, Hiroshi.

00:06:11.570 --> 00:06:13.100
You're wide open.

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:24.120
Sorry we're late, Soumei-san.

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:29.740
It's the poison you wanted.

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:33.070
What the hell is with your timing?

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:36.750
Ogi!

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:37.800
Hold it.

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:39.900
You stay right there.

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:42.130
This would all be for naught
if you healed him now.

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:44.200
Don't worry.

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:47.010
I told them to get one that
won't make him suffer...

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:53.430
The hell?! He's majorly suffering, Haruka!

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:56.200
Oh. Sorry. My bad.

00:06:56.200 --> 00:06:57.810
You said that totally monotone!

00:06:57.810 --> 00:06:59.220
I'll heal him if it kills me!

00:06:59.220 --> 00:07:01.970
Stop acting so tough. You've lost.

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:06.690
I'm not bluffing, you damn brat!

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:09.400
I'm not bluffing either, you old coot!

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:12.120
I'm not going to let him die here!

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:13.290
He's my...

00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:14.330
partner!

00:07:16.030 --> 00:07:18.020
Next time, I'd like to see
things the way you do.

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:20.190
Next time...

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:22.230
Let's be partners...

00:07:28.540 --> 00:07:29.260
Damn it!

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:30.720
Ogi!

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:33.900
You brats...

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:35.630
Soumei-san, please pull back!

00:07:35.630 --> 00:07:37.140
Yata's going to die!

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:41.600
I'm not going to forget about today.

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:46.270
You're my prey.

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:50.290
I will arrest you, no matter what.

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:04.960
Sigh...

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:06.840
Wow, he's super depressed.

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:09.240
Well, you can't blame him.

00:08:09.240 --> 00:08:11.900
Soumei totally had his way with
his body while he was out.

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:14.030
By the way,
why's Yuuta depressed, too?

00:08:14.030 --> 00:08:15.660
Sigh...

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:17.350
Oh, we can leave that alone.

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:19.740
He's just sad that Ogi-san
wasn't killed.
Sigh...

00:08:19.740 --> 00:08:20.040
Sigh...

00:08:21.130 --> 00:08:21.980
Ogi.

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:23.570
Hiroshi.

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:26.400
I can't face my subordinate.

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:28.600
I don't know what to do.

00:08:31.770 --> 00:08:34.070
Don't cry! I'll be fine.

00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:36.510
What do you mean, you'll be fine?

00:08:37.490 --> 00:08:39.570
Forget about your subordinate.

00:08:39.570 --> 00:08:41.880
You should care more about not
having bangs anymore, you idiot!

00:08:41.880 --> 00:08:43.830
Only you are worried about that!

00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:51.630
You've burned out this much...

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.130
So cute.

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:57.050
He said the pain medicine is working,
so you can come back in now.

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:02.640
He said you should stay
like this for a while.

00:09:03.820 --> 00:09:05.910
This screws things up a bit.

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:08.420
Get well soon, Soumei-san.

00:09:16.230 --> 00:09:17.220
A little to the right.

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:26.190
Joji...

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:30.250
Seems like your lives are connected...

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:40.060
I'm the only one who can't
move past thirty years ago.

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:50.520
No good! No good at all!

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:06.080
Not bad, Glasses!

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:10.000
Oh, it wasn't a failure.
It just got a little out of control...

00:10:11.320 --> 00:10:12.460
Be careful.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:18.930
What was that?!

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:27.670
Yataro has split personalities,

00:10:27.670 --> 00:10:29.710
and sometimes this
personality comes out.

00:10:29.710 --> 00:10:30.010
Lies
and sometimes this
personality comes out.

00:10:30.010 --> 00:10:31.440
Split personalities?
Lies

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:33.500
What, was he abused as a kid?

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:37.110
He must have been through a lot. Poor guy.

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:39.930
Well, he was raised by a
good-for-nothing foster father.

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:41.820
Who the hell are you talking about?

00:10:42.090 --> 00:10:43.900
So, this one would be Jiro....

00:10:43.900 --> 00:10:44.860
J-Jiro?!
So, this one would be Jiro....

00:10:44.860 --> 00:10:47.810
And the reason that Taro doesn't
talk is because of psychogenesis?

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:48.790
Exactly.

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:52.150
I see. The mystery's been solved.

00:10:52.510 --> 00:10:54.500
But that really is some difference.

00:10:56.280 --> 00:10:57.420
Squee

00:10:58.280 --> 00:11:00.380
Let's go on a date, little girl.

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:04.450
Where'd that come from?!

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:06.330
You're going on a date with Noah-san?

00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:07.160
I mean, Yata is?

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:09.060
Not a bad idea. I'll have Yata go.

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:11.450
Yataro's not going to be
able to seduce Noah.

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:14.520
If words were all it took to
get a woman, it'd be easy.

00:11:15.030 --> 00:11:18.220
If we can lead her on enough,
maybe we can lure her into NORA.

00:11:18.220 --> 00:11:20.790
That's not fair for Noah-san!

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:23.150
Haruka-san, please say something!

00:11:24.170 --> 00:11:26.420
Neither of them would
be bad for each other,

00:11:26.420 --> 00:11:28.120
so I don't see any reason to interfere.

00:11:30.130 --> 00:11:34.460
If the two of them agree to the date...

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:35.670
There isn't a prob—

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:36.500
Snort

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:38.700
Soumei-san!

00:11:38.700 --> 00:11:41.360
Bring out Yata!

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:45.640
Well, I always make him carry my things...

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:45.950
So I thought I'd treat him
to some food sometime...

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:50.640
Smirk
So I thought I'd treat him
to some food sometime...

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:52.960
A date?
You're going on a date with Glasses?

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:54.820
Lorenzo, we shall be having
sekihan tonight!

00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:55.610
I don't want any!

00:11:55.840 --> 00:11:59.490
He's quite a catch.
He's tall, but he's obedient.

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:02.300
He's a bit unreliable,
but he's sincere, he is.

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:04.010
I know, isn't he?
Great, isn't it?

00:12:04.010 --> 00:12:05.440
He eats a lot.

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:07.730
I was wondering if you could
recommend some places to eat.

00:12:07.730 --> 00:12:08.930
Noah...

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:10.840
Please be careful.

00:12:10.840 --> 00:12:13.870
Men are all wolves.

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:16.130
Ahahahahahaha

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:18.390
Oh, Lorenzo, you're such a perv.

00:12:18.390 --> 00:12:19.640
What are you imagining?

00:12:19.640 --> 00:12:20.490
Wh-What?

00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:21.910
Hey! You're turning bright red!

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:23.670
Oh, but I can't see your face.

00:12:23.670 --> 00:12:24.400
All right, then.

00:12:24.400 --> 00:12:28.010
It is settled.
Dinner shall be on me, it shall.

00:12:28.150 --> 00:12:29.790
I love you, Don!

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:32.700
If that's the case,
I don't need dinner tomorrow night.

00:12:33.820 --> 00:12:37.210
I was thinking that she only had
interest in experiments and not men...

00:12:37.210 --> 00:12:39.260
She is a girl, she is.

00:12:39.720 --> 00:12:41.930
Oh, I want to call!

00:12:41.930 --> 00:12:44.530
Yuuta, listen to this!
Accept my moe!

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:48.530
Am I cheating somehow?
No, no. Yuuta is a friend.

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:50.940
He's obsessing over the
wolf, so we're even!

00:12:50.940 --> 00:12:52.040
Moe is moe!

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:57.230
Oh, wait. Yuuta's not my friend.

00:12:57.230 --> 00:12:58.120
He's an enemy.

00:12:59.350 --> 00:13:01.670
What does Yuuta like about the wolf?

00:13:02.400 --> 00:13:04.960
Now that I think about it,
the wolf has glasses, too.

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:08.220
My glasses have split personalities
with a huge gap.

00:13:08.590 --> 00:13:12.220
We'd probably be able to talk
all night just about our glasses.

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:14.800
I've never been on a date.

00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:16.310
What am I supposed to wear?

00:13:16.610 --> 00:13:18.790
I don't want to dress like a kid.

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:22.330
But maybe dressing too much like
an adult will make him back away.

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:25.140
He doesn't talk at all,
so I don't know what he likes.

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:26.700
Yuuta, pick for me!

00:13:28.800 --> 00:13:31.550
I want to see you.
I want to talk to you...

00:13:32.720 --> 00:13:33.790
Yuuta.

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:37.860
Wh-What am I going to do?

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:39.860
What am I going to do?
What am I going to do?

00:13:41.010 --> 00:13:43.170
What the heck?
Yata's actually serious about this!

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:45.250
He's giving off the cool guy aura.

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:46.430
I think you're just imagining it.

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:47.380
Found you!

00:13:48.830 --> 00:13:49.800
Flap, flap, flap...

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:52.830
Did you come to interfere, Mr. Assistant?!

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:54.520
I could ask the same thing of you.

00:13:54.950 --> 00:13:57.520
That's not it! I was just worried...

00:13:57.520 --> 00:13:58.620
Isn't that right, Haruka-san?

00:13:59.160 --> 00:14:00.480
Where are you, Haruka-san?!

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:02.690
You can't even keep an eye on Glasses?

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:04.320
What is your purpose in life?!

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:07.090
Stop yelling! He'll know we're here!

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:10.040
Oh. They think that I haven't
figured out they're there yet...

00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:10.890
Taro?

00:14:13.270 --> 00:14:15.270
Meeting up like this is pretty fresh.

00:14:15.270 --> 00:14:17.130
You're looking pretty handsome today.

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.880
You look pretty, too, Noah-san.

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:23.640
You always look cute,
but today you look more mature,

00:14:23.640 --> 00:14:25.400
which actually emphasizes your loli-ness.

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:26.210
Confident

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:26.530
I welcome that reverse effect.

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:28.300
Fourteen

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:28.760
Thank you very much.
Confident

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:28.950
Thank you very much.

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:29.300
Flat

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:30.840
You've gone beyond my expectations
yet again today.

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:33.070
I can feel my muscle strain dissipating.

00:14:33.070 --> 00:14:35.940
That's right, the loli pressure point
is good for your health.

00:14:35.940 --> 00:14:36.770
Kidding.

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:38.810
Why the hell is he so popular?

00:14:40.090 --> 00:14:41.440
Oh, they've moved!

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:42.060
We're going after them.

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:46.400
You know, I have to wonder about us

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:48.490
following someone around on their date.

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:50.060
Then why are you here?

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:52.070
You have the least to do with any of this.

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:53.160
Wow.

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:56.750
This must look like some strange
kind of fashion sense to you guys.

00:14:57.190 --> 00:15:00.410
The date with Noah is important for NORA.

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:01.830
Don't get in the way.

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:03.460
Don't get me wrong.

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:05.940
I just want the best for Noah, too.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:08.780
It's Noah's first date.

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:11.620
I want it to be a fun memory for her.

00:15:11.620 --> 00:15:12.850
So...

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:15.360
I'll help you guys out.

00:15:15.360 --> 00:15:17.100
Your phoniness is multiplying!

00:15:17.620 --> 00:15:20.260
And so, must-have date
situation number one:

00:15:20.260 --> 00:15:21.920
get surrounded by delinquents.

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:24.080
Hey, bro, you look like
you're having fun.

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:25.360
It's pissing me off!

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:27.610
That's a top-ranked delinquent right there!

00:15:27.930 --> 00:15:31.930
Well, Yataro won't say anything,
so maybe some action is needed.

00:15:31.930 --> 00:15:33.860
What irresponsible crap are you saying?!

00:15:33.860 --> 00:15:35.330
Are you trying to break them, too?

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:38.290
Beats me. I'm not really sure.

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:42.330
But it irritates me when Yataro
and Natsuki are troubled

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:44.020
over something other than myself.

00:15:44.570 --> 00:15:47.710
Meaning, I feel better if I
trouble them with my own hands.

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:49.640
Must-have date situation number two:

00:15:49.640 --> 00:15:51.720
the klutz falls and sprains an ankle,
resulting in a piggyback ride.

00:15:52.060 --> 00:15:53.680
It turned into a banana
road in an instant?!

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:56.510
This isn't good... We can't move.

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:59.020
You're all overestimating
banana peels way too much!

00:16:10.230 --> 00:16:12.030
He used to...

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:14.180
Fall.

00:16:14.180 --> 00:16:14.990
It was useless!

00:16:15.930 --> 00:16:20.000
Why... Why won't you
hold my hand anymore?

00:16:20.320 --> 00:16:22.460
Because you can read information
by touching his hand.

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:26.570
Please stop reading my thoughts!

00:16:26.570 --> 00:16:28.420
I can't help it. I just hear it.

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:31.260
I'm lonely.

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:34.300
It's like Yata's going
somewhere far away.

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:44.520
When you're done crying, let go.

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:48.310
Then I'm just going to keep crying.

00:16:48.310 --> 00:16:49.600
Idiot.
Then I'm just going to keep crying.

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:51.650
What's going on?

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:54.410
Yuuta-kun, it could be that Haruka...

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:57.120
He replaced himself with a dummy?!

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:58.720
No, I am Yuuta.

00:16:58.720 --> 00:17:00.990
Shut up! Yuuta-kun, where'd you go?!

00:17:05.740 --> 00:17:07.700
The whole place reeks of her phoniness.

00:17:08.350 --> 00:17:09.360
I want to hurry and leave.

00:17:11.820 --> 00:17:14.160
He doesn't look like he's having fun.

00:17:14.160 --> 00:17:16.100
I guess it can't be helped
since I'm dragging him

00:17:16.100 --> 00:17:17.330
around while I do stuff I want.

00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:21.390
I wonder if Yuuta would understand.

00:17:23.410 --> 00:17:24.160
I'm going

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:25.140
outside.
I'm going

00:17:34.870 --> 00:17:36.950
Must-have date situation number three:

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:39.680
the rival appears.

00:17:40.550 --> 00:17:42.580
I've come to reveal your true form,

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:43.580
you lying wolf.

00:17:46.390 --> 00:17:47.910
If you get in the way
of people's romance,

00:17:47.910 --> 00:17:49.290
you won't die very pleasantly.

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:50.810
Yataro's one thing,

00:17:50.810 --> 00:17:52.990
but there's no way I can let you have her!

00:17:57.080 --> 00:17:59.680
It might be better if we kill you off.

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:04.220
Yuuta?

00:18:09.140 --> 00:18:09.970
Yuuta!

00:18:11.430 --> 00:18:12.800
All right, the final blow!

00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:12.830
Poke, poke, poke, poke, poke...
All right, the final blow!

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:13.010
Poke, poke, poke, poke, poke...

00:18:13.010 --> 00:18:15.490
Hey, wait a sec, Yuuta! Hold on!
Poke, poke, poke, poke, poke...

00:18:24.960 --> 00:18:27.790
What? You were a wolf, too?

00:18:32.490 --> 00:18:34.510
Why, you idiot?!

00:18:34.510 --> 00:18:36.550
There's no way the Don
would allow a wolf!

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:37.580
Do you want to die?!

00:18:37.580 --> 00:18:40.240
He's a bit unreliable,
but he's sincere, he is.

00:18:40.240 --> 00:18:44.250
The Don believed in you!
Why did you lie to us?!

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:47.310
Haruka-san.

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:51.590
Please take care of Natsuki.

00:18:56.710 --> 00:18:58.400
Please, Noah-san.

00:19:00.100 --> 00:19:02.130
In exchange for my life, please...

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:05.510
please grant two requests.

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:09.920
I'm sorry, Soumei-san.

00:19:11.030 --> 00:19:15.260
Please let me...
let me protect Natsuki in the end.

00:19:17.180 --> 00:19:20.470
Please don't tell Natsuki
that I'm a wolf!

00:19:21.290 --> 00:19:24.590
They had no idea about this...

00:19:29.660 --> 00:19:31.800
He's planning to sacrifice himself?

00:19:35.190 --> 00:19:36.250
And lastly...

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:39.560
Please save Soumei-san!

00:19:41.390 --> 00:19:43.700
Wait a second. What do you mean?

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:48.510
Sorry, Missy.

00:19:48.510 --> 00:19:49.460
Jiro?

00:19:49.460 --> 00:19:51.490
I'm Soumei-san.

00:19:51.880 --> 00:19:53.750
I thought you might be able to save me,

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:55.460
so I got closer to the mafia.

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:56.460
My apologies.

00:19:56.730 --> 00:20:00.600
As you can see, I don't have a body
right now, so I'm borrowing Yataro's.

00:20:01.110 --> 00:20:03.010
I've been living like this
for over thirty years now.

00:20:03.920 --> 00:20:07.190
I happen to be special
even among werewolves,

00:20:07.190 --> 00:20:10.030
and because of that,
they've frozen my body,

00:20:10.030 --> 00:20:13.110
and it's being carefully held somewhere.

00:20:14.030 --> 00:20:16.700
Hold on a sec.
This was thirty years ago, right?

00:20:16.700 --> 00:20:18.780
Freezing wouldn't be enough.

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:20.250
Not even with the current technology.

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:24.160
Yeah, I was wondering what I'd
do even if I found my body.

00:20:24.970 --> 00:20:28.490
But if I do find it,
I'll need your help, Missy.

00:20:29.600 --> 00:20:32.620
How about it?
As a doctor, as a scientist,

00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:33.810
doesn't that sound intriguing?

00:20:34.510 --> 00:20:37.450
You want to challenge the geniuses
from thirty years ago, don't you?

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:41.070
I'll give you permission to
use Yataro's body, as well.

00:20:41.510 --> 00:20:44.800
You can study the
rare werewolf all you want.

00:20:45.310 --> 00:20:47.450
If you have any terms,
go ahead and state them.

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:50.330
All I want is you.

00:20:51.010 --> 00:20:52.000
Hey, you brat.

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:53.540
You better take responsibility
for ruining the date!

00:20:53.540 --> 00:20:54.810
Blank

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:56.650
Get away from me, you frozen geezer.

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:58.690
You'd better take her to dinner.

00:21:07.150 --> 00:21:09.160
Should I go home, too?

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:10.580
No...

00:21:12.220 --> 00:21:15.220
There's a myriad of things
I want to talk to you about.

00:21:15.220 --> 00:21:18.500
Who else am I supposed
to talk to about all this?

00:21:19.400 --> 00:21:21.820
I don't want to dwell on
all this alone anymore.

00:21:24.460 --> 00:21:25.430
Hey.

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:29.640
You idiot!

00:21:30.150 --> 00:21:32.200
Yata, you idiot!

00:21:38.280 --> 00:21:40.480
Well, we were complete outsiders.

00:21:41.280 --> 00:21:42.630
Don't let it get to you.

00:21:42.630 --> 00:21:43.520
What do you mean?

00:21:43.920 --> 00:21:46.480
Seriously, why are you even in NORA?

00:21:46.480 --> 00:21:48.200
Inaba-san is super worried about you.

00:21:48.690 --> 00:21:50.660
I have something I need to do in NORA.

00:21:50.920 --> 00:21:53.040
And exactly what is that?!

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:54.070
I won't tell.

00:21:54.070 --> 00:21:55.200
Jeez...

00:23:37.120 --> 00:23:40.400
Why didn't <i>we</i> win the Academy Award?!
